    "%@ Apple's Private Cloud Compute can analyze the photo instead. The photo is sent to Apple, which designs it not to keep the photo. This needs a network connection and counts toward a daily limit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ Stattdessen kann Apples Private Cloud Compute das Foto analysieren. Das Foto wird an Apple gesendet, das so konzipiert ist, dass es das Foto nicht speichert. Dafür ist eine Netzwerkverbindung nötig, und es zählt zu einem Tageslimit."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ Apple's Private Cloud Compute can analyze the photo instead. The photo is sent to Apple, which designs it not to keep the photo. This needs a network connection and counts toward a daily limit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
